  "record": {
    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "Corrected the unsaved-close flow. Clicking Close, using a Windows close request such as Alt+F4, or returning through LEXEDITOR now uses the same three actions: Save and Exit, Exit Without Saving, and Cancel. Save and Exit closes only after every pending edit saves; a failed or incomplete save keeps the editor open with the error. Rendered RDR2 and Warband checks passed all three choices, clean immediate close, dirty-state synchronization with the native host, and unchanged live settings.",
